WEBVTT

00:11:29.127 --> 00:11:30.549
(Laughter)

00:11:30.573 --> 00:11:31.878
"We love that!"

00:11:31.902 --> 00:11:32.989
(Laughter)

00:11:33.013 --> 00:11:34.893
"That little tracker on the computer?

00:11:34.917 --> 00:11:36.758
When are you going to do the next one?

00:11:36.782 --> 00:11:38.614
We can't wait to follow the next one."

00:11:38.638 --> 00:11:40.818
Well, they were just there for 53 hours,

00:11:40.842 --> 00:11:42.787
and I was there for years.

00:11:43.229 --> 00:11:46.634
And so there won't be another
epic journey in the ocean.

00:11:46.658 --> 00:11:50.209
But the point is, and the point was,

00:11:50.233 --> 00:11:54.486
that every day of our lives is epic.

00:11:55.417 --> 00:11:57.889
And I'll tell you,
when I walked up onto that beach,

00:11:57.913 --> 00:11:59.751
staggered up onto that beach ...

00:11:59.908 --> 00:12:06.335
I had so many times,
in a very puffed-up ego way,